{
  "title": "Call Flows: Inbound, Outbound and Callback Calls Step by Step | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "This video follows a call from start to finish in the CrestApps Contact Center for Orchard Core: an inbound call with its recording notice, welcome, menu, queue, offer and wrap-up; an outbound call and the checks it passes before it dials; and a callback. For each stage you see the screen that controls it.\n\nIn this video:\n• The life of an inbound call\n• The entry point: welcome message and phone menu\n• Queue treatment: hold music, place in line, estimated wait and callback\n• Limits, overflow and voicemail\n• After the call: dispositions and the subject flow\n• An outbound call: the checks and what the dialer records\n• A callback",
